hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"561","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se) aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Lekin Allah Taala un donon key sath apne bandon ko daraata hai. (Bukhari: 1040 aur 1048)"
"562","[AI-translation] Aur Mugheera bin Shoaba (Raziallahu anhu) se aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein sooraj ko gehan laga jis din Ibrahim faut huey. To logon ne kaha: Ibrahim ki maut key liye sooraj ko gehan laga hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak sooraj aur chaand kisi ki maut aur na zindagi key liye gehan mein aatey hain. Phir jab tum dekho to namaz padho aur Allah se dua karo. (Bukhari: 1043)"
"563","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein sooraj ko gehan laga to pukaara gaya: Beshak namaz jama karney wali hai. (Bukhari: 1045)"
"564","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi hain ke aik Yahoodi aurat un se maangney aai aur us ne un se kaha: Allah tumhey qabr key azaab se panaah dey. To Aisha (Raziallahu anha) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha: Kya log apni qabron mein azaab diye jaaengey? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us se Allah ki panaah maangtey huey. Phir unhon-ne gehan ki hadees zikr ki, phir uskey aakhir mein kaha: Phir unhey hukm diya ke wo qabr key azaab se panaah maangein. (Bukhari: 1049)"
"565","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne gehan ki hadees lambi zikr ki, phir kaha: Ham ne tumhey dekha ke tum ne apne maqaam mein kisi cheez ki taraf haath badhaaya, phir ham ne tumhey dekha ke tum peechey hatey? To Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main ne Jannat dekhi aur angoor ka khosha liya. Aur agar main use paa leta to tum us mein se khaatey jab tak duniya baaqi rehti. Aur mujhey aag dikhaai gai. To main ne aaj jaisa manzar kabhi na dekha jo zyada khaufnaak ho. Aur main ne us mein rehne walon mein aksar auratein dekhein. Unhon-ne kaha: Kis wajah se Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Unki naashukri ki wajah se. Kaha gaya: Kya wo Allah ki naashukri karti hain? Aap ne farmaya: Wo shohar ki naashukri karti hain aur ehsaan ki naashukri karti hain. Agar tum un mein se kisi se saara zamaana ehsaan karo, phir wo tum se kuchh dekhey to kahegi: Main ne tum se kabhi koi bhalai nahi dekhi. (Bukhari: 1052)"
"566","[AI-translation] Asma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sooraj gehan mein ghulaam aazaad karney ka hukm diya. (Bukhari: 1054)"
"567","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Sooraj ko gehan laga. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghabra kar khadey huey, khauf khaatey huey ke Qiyaamat ho. To Aap masjid mein aey aur sab se lamba qiyaam aur ruku aur sajda kya jo main ne Aap ko kabhi kartey huey dekha. Aur farmaya: Ye nishaaniyaan jo Allah bhejta hai kisi ki maut aur na zindagi key liye hotein hain. Lekin Allah unkey sath apne bandon ko daraata hai. Phir jab tum us mein se kuchh dekho to uskey zikr aur us se dua aur us se maghfirat ki taraf daudo. (Bukhari: 1059)"
"568","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chaand gehan ki namaz mein apni qiraat buland aawaaz se ki. Phir jab Aap apni qiraat se faarigh huey to takbeer kahi aur ruku kya. Aur jab rakat se (sar) uthaaya to farmaya: Allah uski sunta hai jo uski hamd karta hai, ae hamaarey Rab aur terey liye hamd hai. Phir chaand gehan ki namaz mein qiraat dohraatey: Do rakatein mein chaar rakatein aur chaar sajdey. (Bukhari: 1065). Surah Sajda key abwaab aur uski sunnat."
